1
00:00:00,065 --> 00:00:01,793
You're never going pro

2
00:00:01,813 --> 00:00:03,890
if you can't read this.

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,408
It's called the Zero Cut.

4
00:00:05,428 --> 00:00:07,331
It starts by selling a handoff.

5
00:00:07,621 --> 00:00:09,271
The big catches up top.

6
00:00:09,501 --> 00:00:11,421
The guard sprints toward him,

7
00:00:11,441 --> 00:00:13,031
and his defender follows.

8
00:00:13,514 --> 00:00:15,508
He thinks the ball's coming sideways.

9
00:00:15,528 --> 00:00:16,831
Watch his feet.

10
00:00:17,506 --> 00:00:19,111
But there's no handoff!

11
00:00:19,131 --> 00:00:20,714
The cutter slips behind him,

12
00:00:20,734 --> 00:00:23,371
takes the pass, and finishes.

13
00:00:24,389 --> 00:00:25,301
Sell the handoff,

14
00:00:25,321 --> 00:00:26,701
cut behind the defender,

15
00:00:26,721 --> 00:00:29,111
and force the low help to choose.

16
00:00:29,454 --> 00:00:31,041
If that help steps across,

17
00:00:31,061 --> 00:00:33,041
the corner is open.

18
00:00:33,061 --> 00:00:34,453
Don't force the layup,

19
00:00:34,473 --> 00:00:35,331
kick it out.

20
00:00:36,009 --> 00:00:37,331
Same action.

21
00:00:37,351 --> 00:00:38,277
Two reads.

22
00:00:38,297 --> 00:00:40,371
That's basketball IQ.

